      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hey can you take a look at this and the follow-up CL and see if this looks okay to you? General idea is to have a DynamicAnimator superclass which both keyframe and expression animators will inherit from. The nice thing about havign a single builder is sometimes (e.g. TextAnimators) we need both the expression and the keyframe. This is likely going to continue to be a requirement as we add for new expressions (e.g. loopIn()/loopOut()).\n\nAs part of this, we need to make the Builders for a couple of the Keyframe Animators public.\n\nThe filenames need to change but I didn\u0027t want it to be too confusing in the code review. Thanks",
