      "message": "Another idea would be to add a makeFromExpression() virtual to KeyframeAnimatorBuilder and still call explicitly from bindImpl like above, but without a separate ebuilder argument.\n\n(also rename KeyframeAnimatorBuilder -\u003e AnimatorBuilder, AnimatorBuilder::make() -\u003e AnimatorBuilder::makeFromKeyframes())",
